Hello World!

## Hello, Firecrawl

A tiny "Hello World" example that runs one live web search through
[Firecrawl](https://firecrawl.dev) and prints the top results.

### Setup

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    cp .env.example .env        # then add your key from https://firecrawl.dev
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...

### Run

    python3 hello_firecrawl.py                 # searches for "Hello World"
    python3 hello_firecrawl.py "your query"    # or your own query

The script uses the official `firecrawl-py` SDK and the `search` endpoint.
See the Firecrawl docs at https://docs.firecrawl.dev for other operations
(scrape, crawl, map, extract).
